WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.363
Unit twenty-five. My Health Plan!

2
00:00:04.325 --> 00:00:07.833
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:11.356
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.406 --> 00:00:14.916
Today we learn about My Health Plan. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.751 --> 00:00:18.784
Goal. Say it with me. Goal!

6
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.864
Plan. Say it with me. Plan!

7
00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:32.616
Habit. Say it with me. Habit!

8
00:00:36.113 --> 00:00:39.379
Track. Say it with me. Track!

9
00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:46.666
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

10
00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:53.933
Activity. Say it with me. Activity!

11
00:00:57.431 --> 00:01:00.898
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

12
00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:08.231
Reward. Say it with me. Reward!

13
00:01:11.731 --> 00:01:21.775
A health plan starts with one clear goal. I choose a habit, like more activity or better sleep, and track it each day. When I reach my goal, I give myself a small reward.

14
00:01:21.825 --> 00:01:23.049
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:29.648
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.698 --> 00:01:30.848
Habit!

17
00:01:31.776 --> 00:01:36.883
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.933 --> 00:01:38.083
Sleep!

19
00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.769
Did you know? Tracking a habit on a calendar makes it more likely you will stick with it!

20
00:01:44.819 --> 00:01:46.731
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.444 --> 00:01:55.047
Think and answer. What is one health goal you could track?

22
00:01:55.097 --> 00:01:56.247
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.344 --> 00:02:05.249
Wonderful work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 5. Keep your healthy habits, and see you in Grade 6. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:08.431
Thank you, Nurse Bopha! See you in Grade 6!

